    "sub_name": "全球經營與管理田野研究",
    "sub_ename": "GLOBAL BUSINESS AND MANAGEMENT FIELD STUDY",
    "describe_ch": "這是一門結合移地參訪、閱讀、探索與反觀自省的綜合課程。以田野調查方式收集移地所觀察的資料，加以分析、綜合、評鑑經營模式與管理功能的異同，同時借由透過團隊合作培養同窗革命情感。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a comprehensive course that combines visiting, reading, exploration and reflection. Data collection is through fieldwork. It also analyzes, synthesizes, and evaluates the similarities and differences between the business model and the management style, and at the same time cultivates the revolutionary emotions of the members through teamwork.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
